# Plugin versioning & releases

This repo ships a WordPress plugin (`anhora/`) with independent semver from the Anhora monorepo.

## Version sources (must stay identical)

Bump **all three** together — never leave them out of sync:

1. `anhora/anhora.php` header: `Version: x.y.z`
2. `anhora/anhora.php` constant: `ANHORA_VERSION` (`'x.y.z'`)
3. `anhora/readme.txt`: `Stable tag: x.y.z`

Use semver: `MAJOR.MINOR.PATCH` (start from `0.1.0` until first stable wordpress.org release).

## Do not

- Change only one of the three version fields
- Commit generated zips under `dist/` (except `dist/.gitkeep`)
- Zip the whole git repo for distribution — only the `anhora/` plugin folder
- Push a `v*` tag whose version does not match the three fields above (CI will fail)

## Local zip

```bash
./scripts/build-zip.sh
# → dist/anhora-{version}.zip  (root entry: anhora/)
```

## Publish

1. Bump the three version fields and update `anhora/readme.txt` changelog if needed
2. Commit on `main`
3. Tag and push:

```bash
git tag vX.Y.Z
git push origin main --tags
```

4. GitHub Actions (`.github/workflows/release.yml`) creates a Release with `anhora-X.Y.Z.zip`

Stable download URL for merchants:  
https://github.com/denys-vodniakov/anhora-wordpress/releases/latest

If Actions are unavailable, create the Release manually with the zip from `./scripts/build-zip.sh`.

## When editing related files

Prefer applying this rule when touching: `anhora/anhora.php`, `anhora/readme.txt`, `scripts/build-zip.sh`, `.github/workflows/release.yml`, or preparing any release/tag.
